    "notes":  [
                  "New field built to the standard car-soccer layout: bigger pitch, cut corners, standard goals, the 34-pad boost layout and standard kickoff spots",
                  "Standard car and ball proportions with a box hitbox and genre-style ball hits",
                  "Much smarter bots: they predict the ball, time their hits, flip into shots, save, rotate and grab boost",
                  "Night stadium: starry sky, floodlights, glowing boost and lights (Day still in Settings \u003e Video)",
                  "Cars can land on their roof and stay flipped: press jump to roll back onto your wheels",
                  "Smoother car animation: no more sudden snaps on landings, corners and wall changes",
                  "Camera uses the standard settings and rolls with you on walls",
                  "All new sounds: engine, boost roar, heavy ball hits, jumps, flips, pickups, goal explosion, horn and crowd cheer"
